cdtk-doctor: Bilingual Environment & Connectivity Health Doctor for CoreDevice RSD (cdtk)
Supports English (default) and Chinese (--zh / --cn / auto-detect LANG=zh).
Audits system dependencies, Python modules, pairing files (0600 permissions),
loopback network status, and on-device wake/unlock handshake.
Provides immediate, copy-paste repair instructions for any failure.
"""

